            {
                "entry_id": "88bd9bcc-c637-36ca-aecf-8794e24db2b9",
                "word": "antagonique",
                "pos": "adj",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "09400bb1-d6b9-4ce7-bf51-a6d1c1cbc6f5",
                        "entry_id": "88bd9bcc-c637-36ca-aecf-8794e24db2b9",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "masculine",
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "form": "antagoniques"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f25c72e5-32bf-366f-b8d5-b468c498905e",
                        "entry_id": "88bd9bcc-c637-36ca-aecf-8794e24db2b9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qui agit en sens contraire."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7e0e7850-1162-4559-91fc-b1c1c70db04b",
                                "sense_id": "f25c72e5-32bf-366f-b8d5-b468c498905e",
                                "text": "Les citations qui me servent d’épigraphes définissent assez précisément, quoique dans des perspectives différentes, le type d’histoire que j’appelle antagonique."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ae225ad2-5957-43fe-a7ca-696217818622",
                                "sense_id": "f25c72e5-32bf-366f-b8d5-b468c498905e",
                                "text": "Ma vie a été happée par d’autres urgences, par une relation au temps et à autrui antagonique de la discipline et de la sédentarité qu’implique la passion du vol à voile, passion de solitude."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "290c09e9-4559-4dbb-89da-a53e9ed629c9",
                                "sense_id": "f25c72e5-32bf-366f-b8d5-b468c498905e",
                                "text": "Pendant ce temps, sur le terrain du réel, l’option souverainiste poursuit son agonie. Le rapport Québec-Canada, aussi antagonique soit-il sur ces questions sensibles, survit ainsi bon gré mal gré."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "924a6c56-7cb8-4018-9864-ae769d94eca3",
                                "sense_id": "f25c72e5-32bf-366f-b8d5-b468c498905e",
                                "text": "En présence : deux visions antagoniques de la France, de la politique, de la nation, voire de la démocratie."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "56551b98-ae3a-4d85-8c97-41d177591fd1",
                                "sense_id": "f25c72e5-32bf-366f-b8d5-b468c498905e",
                                "text": "Être dans un rapport antagonique."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "0568b87d-6484-43a2-85f9-176937badec5",
                        "source_entry_id": "88bd9bcc-c637-36ca-aecf-8794e24db2b9",
                        "source_sense_id": "f25c72e5-32bf-366f-b8d5-b468c498905e",
                        "target_lang_word": "adversarial",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "adversarial",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6e1fcb0d-9e98-32b8-8774-556348361754",
                                        "entry_id": "d63016d4-abf7-359d-a72c-f8088caaafc8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Characteristic of, or in the manner of, an adversary; combative, hostile, opposed."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4f33c4c6-1ec7-463d-bb0d-971c45067ffb",
                                                "sense_id": "6e1fcb0d-9e98-32b8-8774-556348361754",
                                                "text": "In polling by the Pew Research Center in November 2008, fully half the respondents thought the two parties would cooperate more in the coming year, versus only 36 percent who thought the climate would grow more adversarial."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f43bdb17-470f-4241-bacd-9ca0c4eb6b27",
                                                "sense_id": "6e1fcb0d-9e98-32b8-8774-556348361754",
                                                "text": "The White Paper therefore aims to tackle complexity rather then ownership of the railways, and to eliminate \"the adversarial relationships between operators, suppliers, NR and government\"."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9346c6e1-0992-3162-be79-8bf82d3cbe67",
                                        "entry_id": "d63016d4-abf7-359d-a72c-f8088caaafc8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In which issues are tried through the presentation of evidence and argument by adverse parties, with no or limited inquiry by the court's own initiative."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "34405200-4fb8-4a10-9ab9-984dc3b231b8",
                                                "sense_id": "9346c6e1-0992-3162-be79-8bf82d3cbe67",
                                                "text": "Canada uses an adversarial system of criminal justice, whereas France uses an inquisitorial model."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "86587b5f-7f0c-478a-ad8b-685e471599b1",
                        "source_entry_id": "88bd9bcc-c637-36ca-aecf-8794e24db2b9",
                        "source_sense_id": "f25c72e5-32bf-366f-b8d5-b468c498905e",
                        "target_lang_word": "antagonistic",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "antagonistic",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c13e2734-ddfe-3bf2-a522-114240cca61c",
                                        "entry_id": "251b561c-f87c-3ec0-a1bd-3b2b60cea3bd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Contending or acting against."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "544b9288-33df-4211-8e61-7aabb26cd70e",
                                                "sense_id": "c13e2734-ddfe-3bf2-a522-114240cca61c",
                                                "text": "They were distinct, adverse, even antagonistic."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c16f4945-0492-448d-bbdf-161436eeeb8f",
                                                "sense_id": "c13e2734-ddfe-3bf2-a522-114240cca61c",
                                                "text": "Though the tephrosia is a powerful agent, and, if carried too far beyond the antagonistic action of the poison, is, I presume, not entirely without danger, I have never known any bad symptoms to arise from its use."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "52440d41-1df2-44a3-8b44-29ce724c59f2",
                                                "sense_id": "c13e2734-ddfe-3bf2-a522-114240cca61c",
                                                "text": "And deputies from opposing parties, inherently more antagonistic than deputies from the same party, can be bought at a lower price."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7f47de4f-c65d-428e-a96c-2894f4389524",
                                                "sense_id": "c13e2734-ddfe-3bf2-a522-114240cca61c",
                                                "text": "The tone of congressional hearings involving tech industry executives in recent years can best be described as antagonistic."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4451cee5-177c-3d08-91d2-16bdd7bd4e56",
                                        "entry_id": "251b561c-f87c-3ec0-a1bd-3b2b60cea3bd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Relating to an antagonist."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
